            "expected_output": "cleaned_text=https://www.buch24.de/shopdirekt.cgi?id=13241297&p=3&static=0\nurl_count=1\nurl[0]=https://www.buch24.de/shopdirekt.cgi?id=13241297&p=3&static=0\n"
        },
        {
